    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "怎么，吓一跳，侧耳朵听就可以了！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What, startled? Just prick up your ears and listen!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "……大便不多占用时间吧……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Taking a dump does not take that much time, does it...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "说得对，那家伙巧妙地逃走了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "That is right, the fellow slipped away cleverly...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "她会叫唤起来吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "She will start crying out, won't she?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "……茫然若失吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...She will be left stunned and lost, won't she?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "……也许会悄悄落几滴眼泪吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Maybe she will quietly shed a few tears?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "……不管怎样，反正已经没我的责任了……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...In any case, it is no longer my responsibility now...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00907",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "不需要镜子的本来就是你自己嘛。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You were the one who never needed a mirror in the first place.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
